@@ -31,3 +31,14 @@ a script is run to transform the shared library into a loadable extension by app
 to the `build/debug` directory.
 
 To create optimized release binaries, simply run `make release` instead.
+
+## Parameter handles
+
+`odbc_create_params()` creates a reusable parameter handle for `odbc_query(..., params_handle := handle)` and
+`odbc_bind_params(...)`. Parameter handles are independent of query plans and remain registered until explicitly
+released with `odbc_destroy_params(handle)`. Deallocate prepared statements that use the handle before releasing it.
+
+```sql
+DEALLOCATE query_stmt;
+SELECT odbc_destroy_params(getvariable('params'));
+```
